    "created_at": "2018-02-16T19:55:30Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-02-16T19:55:30Z",
    "body": "By \"xref\" we mean \"cross-reference\", i.e. a link. In the HTML spec, those are done via `<span>obtain numeric values</span>` or sometimes `<span data-x=\"something\">obtain numeric values</span>`.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
